abstract: >
  Corrected donor-level reanalysis of Geneformer V1 embeddings against
  pseudobulk and age-only baselines for SLE-versus-healthy discrimination.
  The corrected shared-gene external AUROCs are 0.7344, 0.8984, and 0.5781,
  respectively. The external cohort had already been examined, so this release
  is a corrected reanalysis rather than a new untouched confirmatory validation.
